{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>After he sent her away.</b> After she had sent to him to know what place was his resting-place, and he informed her that he would not rest until the mountain of Elohim, where they would serve Him — as He had promised in saying: תַּעַבְדוּן אֶת הָאֱלֹהִים עַל הָהָר הַזֶּה (Exodus 3:12). Therefore Jethro delayed his coming until Moses and his people were there."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:01.992431931Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}